<title>USA: Iowa City, Iowa, won by Prudential.</title>
<headline>Iowa City, Iowa, won by Prudential.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities said it won $5.2 million of Iowa City, Iowa, general obligation bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.7954 percent.</p>
</text>
